# Auto-push when done

When you finish a task that includes code changes in this repo:

1. Commit with a clear message if there are uncommitted changes.
2. Push to the tracked remote branch immediately.
3. Do not ask whether to push — the user wants pushes by default after completed work.

Only skip pushing when the user explicitly says not to push, or when there are no changes to commit.
